## DONE — Shift Analysis (`/performance`)

- Retired as an **active page** (not merely hidden nav)
- Redirect `/performance` → `/management/rinse-wf` before mount
- Do not initialize Shift Monitor or preload SA APIs
- Keep validated calculation functions for reuse/extract; delete later when safe

