## PLANNED — Supply Usage (`/maintenance/supply-usage`)

**Owner:** Management Rinse WF (operational Supply Usage).

Compact authoritative supply-summary path (async, never blocks WF core):

- Tide · Downy · Oxi · All Free & Clear
- Summary first; order/bag detail on demand

**Do not** keep the old Supply Usage page running/fetching in parallel once Management fully replaces its useful operational functionality.

**When ready (not until Rinse WF supplies section covers manager needs):**

- Remove Supply Usage from primary navigation
- Redirect `/maintenance/supply-usage` → `/management/rinse-wf` (or supply detail) **before** mount
- Confirm 0 legacy Supply Usage API requests after redirect
- Keep authoritative supply mapping/calculation functions; do **not** duplicate formulas
- Future Supply Master / cost config = small Management settings/detail surface, not another giant ops page

**Current status:** Supplies are async on Rinse WF. **Route retirement NOT yet authorized** — still a planned retirement.

