## PLANNED — Revenue & Cost (`/finance/daily-revenue-cost` and related)

Management Revenue (`/management/revenue`) becomes the management-facing home:

- RINSE WF
- RINSE HD
- NON-RINSE → Self Service · Drop Off · DHS

Revenue & Cost is also a **data entry** surface. Rules:

- **Do not** create two editable sources of truth
- Initially Management Revenue may reuse existing Revenue & Cost write APIs/storage
- Then move/reuse input controls into Management Revenue
- Retire the old page **only after** Management supports the required entry/edit workflow

**End-state:**

- `/management/revenue` = view + entry/edit
- Old Revenue & Cost route redirects to `/management/revenue` **before** legacy mount
- No hidden legacy DRC dashboard requests

### Canonical revenue sources (do not merge incompatible definitions)

| Surface | Source |
|---|---|
| Rinse HD | Order-level # items + total order revenue from canonical HD production storage |
| Non-Rinse | Self Service / Drop Off / DHS **daily** revenue |
| Rinse WF | Do **not** silently present estimated production value as actual revenue; use approved/canonical WF revenue basis when finalized |

**Current status:** **Do not migrate Revenue & Cost in the current ops pass.** Execute in the Revenue compartment phase.

